,"containerId":"dZOHw_SEopY45I-P4bTDd","originalText":"In der Realität wird jedoch statt der Wärmeströmung die Wärmestrahlung der Erdoberfläche durch die Atmosphäre absorbiert und teilweise zur Erdoberfläche zurückgestrahlt. ","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"labelPosition":null,"baseFontSize":null},{"id":"-0SU6ndUv8PiLEj4NOwhr","type":"rectangle","x":1705.6963679494343,"y":-203.9948945163524,"width":209.01993545981767,"height":63,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"transparent","backgroundColor":"#92bbfa","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["r6Xhp3j5fYRp-XvPzJddk"],"frameId":null,"index":"b8h","roundness":null,"seed":1582826079,"version":248,"versionNonce":915156657,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"F1h4ZemNr1eJvI9uz35KL"},{"id":"8rRCERHfH5FoL_y60JVQs","type":"arrow"},{"id":"F6EKJA5yCkjKP10QkrbU4","type":"arrow"}],"updated":1794738480830,"created":1794390047799,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"F1h4ZemNr1eJvI9uz35KL","type":"text","x":1717.8729998028782,"y":-198.68444386206295,"width":184.6666717529297,"height":52.37909869142112,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["r6Xhp3j5fYRp-XvPzJddk"],"frameId":null,"index":"b8hG","roundness":null,"seed":570842751,"version":231,"versionNonce":1654221163,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1794401709062,"created":1794390047799,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Wir Menschen sind aber nicht in der Lage\njede Art von Strahlung zu sehen, daher\nbleiben viele Strahlungsvorgänge unserem\nAuge verborgen. Wir können sie aber mit\nunserer Haut wahrnehmen. ","fontSize":8.38065579062738,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"-0SU6ndUv8PiLEj4NOwhr","originalText":"Wir Menschen sind aber nicht in der Lage jede Art von Strahlung zu sehen, daher bleiben viele Strahlungsvorgänge unserem Auge ve